@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Player
participant "System" as System

activate Player

    Player -> System : asks to build a station
    activate System

    System --> Player : shows the list of available scenarios
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects a scenario
    activate System

    System --> Player : asks for the XY coordinates
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : types the XY coordinates
    activate System

    System --> Player : checks if the coordinates selected are occupied \n and recommends a name based on the closest city
    deactivate System

    alt recommended name

    Player -> System : selects the recommended name
    activate System

    end alt

    alt typed name

    Player -> System : types a different name

    end alt

    System --> Player: shows the list of available types
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects a type from the available ones
    activate System

    alt Depot or Terminal

    System --> Player: defines the center as the geometric one \n and displays all data for confirmation

    end alt

    alt Station

        System --> Player: asks for the center compass coordinate \n as the geometric one
        deactivate System

        Player -> System : types the compass coordinate wanted
        activate System

        System --> Player: shows all data and requests confirmation
        deactivate System

    end alt

        Player -> System : confirms data
        activate System

        System --> Player : builds the station and displays success
        deactivate System


@enduml